    "longDescription": "By installing this app, you agree to the End User License Agreement at - https://mobile-app.plugins.oci.oraclecloud.com/prod/iOS-EULA-22May2019.pdf\n\nThe Oracle Cloud Infrastructure Mobile App lets customers review alerts, notifications, and limits on-the-go. Quickly access information about infrastructure resources, billing, and usage data from your Apple devices. Use the mobile app to see:\n \n* Alarms fired within the last 24 hours.\n* Details about your resources, such as visualizations with metrics that let you monitor the health, capacity, and performance of your resources.\n* Current service limits and usage.\n* Information about costs associated with resource usage for trial users.",
